  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h2 data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"161\" id=\"isPasted\">About Our Brand and Products</h2><p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"651\">At <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"191\">Australian Flag Makers</strong>, we specialise in creating high-quality, custom-printed flags. Proudly Australian-owned and operated, we use advanced <strong data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"384\">dye sublimation printing technology</strong> to produce vibrant, durable flags that stand out indoors or outdoors. Our products include <strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"558\">custom flags, hand flags, bunting, and more</strong>, all designed to help businesses, organisations, and events showcase their brand with pride.</p><hr data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\"><h2 data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"684\">What Makes Us Different</h2><ul data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"1330\"><li data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"800\"><p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"707\">Australian Made:</strong> We print and finish our products locally, ensuring top quality and quick turnaround times.</p></li><li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"937\"><p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"937\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"833\">State-of-the-Art Printing:</strong> Our direct-to-fabric dye sublimation process produces vivid, long-lasting colours that resist fading.</p></li><li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1214\"><p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1214\"><strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1115\">Trusted by Businesses Nationwide:</strong> From government departments to schools and major events, our products are seen across Australia.</p></li><li data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1330\"><p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1330\"><strong data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1246\">Eco-Conscious Production:</strong> We use environmentally friendly inks and sustainable materials wherever possible.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1335\