, banners, and content to make promotion easy.</p><hr data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2300\"><h2 data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2322\">Other Information</h2><ul data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2652\"><li data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2422\"><p data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2422\"><strong data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2347\">Commission payouts</strong> are made monthly.</p></li><li data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2541\"><p data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2541\">You’ll have access to a <strong data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2482\">dedicated affiliate dashboard</strong> to track clicks, conversions, and earnings in real time.</p></li><li data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2652\"><p data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2652\">Our <strong data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2564\">support team</strong> is here to help you with product information, creative assets, and promotional ideas.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2771\">Join our affiliate program today and start earning by promoting one of Australia’s leading custom flag manufacturers.</p></div></div>",
